<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 76, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: '#FFC107' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>为什么 ViT 会在小数据上失利</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8FC0F0' }}>06 实验结果与分析</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 604, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, paddingTop: 20, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingBottom: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <svg width={670} height={470} viewBox='0 0 670 470'>
                <text x='335' y='24' fill='#0E3F8C' font-size='19' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>性能随训练数据规模的变化（示意图，基于 ViT 原文的结论）</text>

                <path d='M80 70 V 400 H 630' stroke='#8B97A8' strokeWidth='2' fill='none' />
                <text x='355' y='432' fill='#8B97A8' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>训练数据规模 →（对数刻度）</text>
                <text x='56' y='84' fill='#8B97A8' font-size='16' text-anchor='end' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>性能</text>

                <path d='M110 380 C 190 300 240 190 330 150 S 520 128 620 122' fill='none' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='4' />
                <path d='M110 386 C 200 372 260 340 340 250 S 520 150 620 100' fill='none' stroke='#D9534F' strokeWidth='4' strokeDasharray='10 6' />

                <path d='M232 70 V 400' stroke='#FFC107' strokeWidth='3' strokeDasharray='7 5' />
                <circle cx='232' cy='352' r='8' fill='#1E4FA8' />
                <circle cx='232' cy='376' r='8' fill='#D9534F' />
                <rect x='150' y='54' width='164' height='42' rx='6' fill='#FFF8E1' stroke='#FFC107' strokeWidth='2' />
                <text x='232' y='81' fill='#0E3F8C' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>本实验：544 张</text>

                <rect x='470' y='66' width='180' height='60' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D6DCE5' strokeWidth='1' />
                <path d='M484 88 H 512' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='4' />
                <text x='522' y='94' fill='#1A2230' font-size='15' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>CNN（ResNet）</text>
                <path d='M484 110 H 512' stroke='#D9534F' strokeWidth='4' strokeDasharray='10 6' />
                <text x='522' y='116' fill='#1A2230' font-size='15' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>ViT</text>

                <text x='600' y='146' fill='#D9534F' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>大数据区反超</text>
                <text x='600' y='166' fill='#8B97A8' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>（JFT-300M 预训练）</text>
                <text x='400' y='212' fill='#1E4FA8' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>小数据区 CNN 明显领先</text>

                <rect x='80' y='446' width='550' height='0' fill='none' />
            </svg>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, paddingLeft: 16, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9 }}>
                <FAIcon name='info-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>这不是"ViT 不行"，而是"数据不够"</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>卷积白送的三条先验</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    局部性、平移等变、权重共享。它们让 CNN 即使只看过几百张图，也能合理地把"边缘、纹理、形状"组合起来——相当于把人类积累的视觉知识编译进了结构。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '5px solid #D9534F', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>ViT 要从零学这些</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    85.8 M 参数、197×197 的注意力矩阵，自由度极高。ViT 原文明确指出：在 ImageNet-1K（130 万张）上从零训练时，ViT 略逊于同规模 ResNet；只有在 JFT-300M（3 亿张）预训练后才反超。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF8E1', border: '1px solid #FFC107', borderLeft: '5px solid #FFC107', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>本实验正好落在左侧区间</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    544 张训练图比 ViT 的需求低了三到六个数量级。即便加载了 ImageNet 预训练权重，注意力头仍需要足够数据才能适配超声图像的域差异——结果是恶性召回仅 53%。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>BUSI 乳腺超声图像分类 · 乳腺癌智能诊断</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>32 / 38</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
